\section{Conclusion}
AZ-Kerberos demonstrates that closed-loop risk-adaptive authorization can be integrated into stock MIT Kerberos with zero protocol changes, sub-15-nanosecond lookup latency, provable victim lock-out protection, and cryptographically bound audit accountability.

